里之外，吾不如子房。鎮國家，撫百姓，給餽饢，不絕糧道，吾不如蕭何。連百萬之軍，戰必勝，攻必取，吾不如韓信。此三者，皆人傑也，吾能用之，此吾所以取天下也。項羽有一范增而不能用，此其所以為我擒也。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m057-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m057-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m057-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"高起","kind":"person","person_id":"oxi_zcr_uxa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m057-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"王陵","kind":"person","person_id":"5do_703_rfz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m057-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m057-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m057-0141","start":141,"end":143,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m057-0176","start":176,"end":178,"surface":"子房","kind":"person","person_id":"ea5_zvr_hlp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m057-0199","start":199,"end":201,"surface":"蕭何","kind":"person","person_id":"xd8_uww_5ok","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m057-0219","start":219,"end":221,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"ofc_8ei_jb7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m057-0245","start":245,"end":247,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m057-0249","start":249,"end":251,"surface":"范增","kind":"person","person_id":"uw6_a0a_tjp","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-